[8.182496, "o", "# Fixed\r\n\r\n- From: agent says done without proof\r\n- To: agent shows exact verification output\r\n- Lesson: les_20260604191959_jffq\r\n- Local store: .better-every-run/\r\n- Durable file changed: none\r\n"]
[10.123091, "o", "\r\n# 2. Report shows the lesson and where it should go\r\n"]
[12.026447, "o", "\r\n$ ber report --today\r\n"]
[12.864673, "o", "# Better Every Run report (today)\r\n\r\n## Storage\r\n\r\n- Local store: .better-every-run/\r\n- Durable files changed: none\r\n\r\n## Counts\r\n\r\n- Events captured: 1\r\n- Lessons proposed: 1\r\n- Open proposals: 0\r\n- Accepted: 1\r\n- Rejected: 0\r\n- Quarantined: 0\r\n- Superseded: 0\r\n- Promoted: 0\r\n- Expired: 0\r\n\r\n## Event types\r\n\r\n- correction: 1\r\n\r\n## Recent evidence\r\n\r\n- evt_20260604191959_ayxh | correction: When this happens: agent says done without proof. Prefer this outcome: agent shows exact verification output.\r\n\r\n## Open lesson proposals\r\n\r\n- none\r\n\r\n## Promotion suggestions\r\n\r\n- les_20260604191959_jffq | eval/correction: promote to eval\r\n  Review: node scripts/ber.js card les_20260604191959_jffq --to eval --target <markdown-file>\r\n  Apply: node scripts/ber.js promote les_20260604191959_jffq --to eval --target <markdown-file> --require-card\r\n\r\n## Next action\r\n\r\nPromote accepted lessons only when they should change memory, a skill, or an eval.\r\n"]
[14.773564, "o", "\r\n# 3. Write a lesson card before touching a durable file\r\n"]
